Z||000000||88formula||09-06-2000||10:05 PM||||I need information on those H684CP Federal Mogul pistons that are used in the 3.4 DOHC engine. I have been told that those pistons will give me a 9.7 to 1 compression ratio in the 3.4 push rod motor with the iron heads. Can anyone please verify this for me?  Everyone I have talked to just tells me they heard that they give you a 9.7 to 1 compression ratio. I don't want to get them and have detonation problems because the compression ratio is actually 11 to 1. <P>||||reg||1
Z||000001||lou_dias||09-07-2000||12:31 PM||||they should be dished pistons for the iron heads and flat with grooves for the aluminum heads.  If they are flat, compression would probably be way to high for the street.||||reg||1
